The only thing that we have not touched upon previously is IEventStoreConnection. All
reads and writes between our application and Event Store need to be executed on the open
TCP connection to the Event Store cluster, which can also be a single-node cluster that we
can create by running the Docker image. Our application will establish the connection
when it starts, and we need to close the connection when the application stops. We will add
