We will be using RavenDB, and although it supports some sort of multi-document
transactions, we won't be doing this to keep the code simpler. So, the first thing I need to do
is to define an interface for the checkpoint store. For this, I add an ICheckpointStore file
to the Marketplace.Framework project. The code is very simple; we only need a couple of
