Position.Start, so that we can subscribe to the very beginning. It replicates the no-
checkpoint situation and, in case you need to rebuild all read models from the ground up,
you just need to remove this document, along with all documents for read models.
When we save the checkpoint, we must try loading one to see if it exists. If it does, we
update it with the new position, otherwise, we store a new document.
